<title>USA: Jason sees Q4 profits lower than expected.</title>
<headline>Jason sees Q4 profits lower than expected.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jason Inc said Friday it expects fourth-quarter profits to be below analysts' estimates due to an increase in the cost of certain projects in its power generation segment.  </p>
<p>The company said it expects earnings for the full year 1996 of $0.42 to $0.44 per share.</p>
<p>&quot;The combination of an increased number of complex international projects, new product introduction and a rapid buildup in backlog caused significant inefficiencies,&quot; it said.</p>
</text>
